# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform. Without this, git's
# Windows default (`core.autocrlf=true`) rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, and
# anything lyr embeds with `include_str!` (the default config, the theme) would
# differ byte-for-byte between Windows builds and the rest.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
